{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38975","headline":"空闲二公递以禅律相鄙因而解之 · 杜荀鹤","name":"空闲二公递以禅律相鄙因而解之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一教谁云辟二途，律禅禅律智归愚。\n念珠在手隳禅衲，禅衲披肩坏念珠。\n象外空分空外象，无中有作有中无。\n有无无有师穷取，山到平来海亦枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}